{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">BUKU PENJELASAN</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">UNTUK</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Bagan Bantu Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">SERI PERTAMA</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">BAGAN No. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Sekolah, sekolah menengah, ruang kelas.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gambaran umum.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Bagan ini menggambarkan sebuah <b>ruang kelas</b> di sebuah <b>sekolah menengah</b>. Di ruang kelas ini ada delapan <b>meja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> dan delapan <b>bangku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Di setiap bangku duduk tiga murid. <b>Guru</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> duduk di <b>kursi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> di <b>meja gurunya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Di sebelah kiri meja guru berdiri <b>lemari</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> <b>berkaca</b>. Di sebelah kanan ada <b>papan tulis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> dengan <b>penghapusnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> dan <b>kapurnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Di atas meja guru tergantung <b>papan peraga</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> dan sebuah <b>peta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Tidak semua murid duduk di <b>tempatnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Ioannes <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> berdiri di depan papan tulis ; ia memegang <b>penghapus</b> itu dan menghapus <b>gambar-gambar geometri.</b>","t01-03-2":"Petrus berdiri dekat meja guru ; ia mengumpulkan <b>tugas menulis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> dan membawanya kepada guru.","t01-04-1":"4. — Guru <b>ini</b> adalah guru <b>bahasa-bahasa hidup.</b> Ia mengajar murid-murid berbicara, membaca dan menulis bahasa asing <b>(Jerman, Inggris, Spanyol, Italia, Rusia atau Prancis)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Ruang kelas itu sangat luas dan sangat terang. Di ujung ruang ada <b>jendela</b> lebar dengan dua <b>boven</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> dan sebuah <b>pintu berkaca</b> untuk mengudarakan dan menerangi ruang itu.","t01-05-2":"Ruang kelas ini tidak dingin. Di tengahnya, untuk menghangatkannya, ada <b>tungku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> yang sangat baik dengan <b>cerobongnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Pada dinding terpasang <b>gantungan baju</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> ; di situ tergantung topi dan mantel murid-murid.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Halaman bermain</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>Jam dinding</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> menunjukkan pukul sembilan lewat lima menit.","t01-06-2":"<b>Waktu istirahat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> baru saja berakhir dan pelajaran dimulai lagi. Tempat bermain terletak di <b>halaman</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Kita melihat beberapa murid yang sedang bermain. Seorang <b>pengawas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> menjaga mereka.","t01-07-1":"7. — Di halaman kita juga melihat beberapa orang lain, yaitu <b>penilik sekolah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>kepala sekolah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> dan <b>wakil kepala sekolah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Penilik memeriksa sekolah-sekolah, kepala sekolah memimpin sekolah menengah itu, dan wakilnya mengawasi pelajaran.","t01-07-3":"Orang keempat adalah <b>penjaga pintu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Ia membawa buku daftar di bawah lengannya untuk mencatat yang tidak hadir.","t01-08-1":"8. — Di ujung halaman ada <b>alat-alat senam</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> dan bengkel untuk <b>kerajinan tangan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Di sebelah kanan bagan ini kita mulai melihat <b>ruang-ruang kelas</b> untuk <b>musik</b> dan <b>menggambar</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gambaran terperinci.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Murid-murid yang baik.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Murid-murid di bangku pertama di sebelah kanan meja guru adalah <b>Henrikus</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"id-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stefanus</b> dan <b>Karolus.</b>","t01-09-2":"Henrikus sangat penuh perhatian dan rajin ; ia mendengarkan guru. Di atas mejanya ada <b>buku tulis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>buku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>kamus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> dan <b>kotak pensil</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Bukunya mempunyai banyak <b>halaman</b> ; setiap bab berisi beberapa <b>paragraf</b> dan setiap <b>baris</b> banyak <b>kata.</b>","t01-09-4":"Tetangganya, Stefanus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button>, sangat bersemangat. Ia mencatat di buku tulisnya pelajaran untuk pertemuan berikutnya. <b>Tulisannya</b> bagus. Bukunya tertutup ; kita hanya melihat <b>sampulnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Di dekatnya ada <b>jangkanya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Karolus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> memegang bukunya dengan tangan ; ia membukanya untuk membaca ulang pelajarannya. Seperti setiap murid, ia mempunyai <b>tempat tinta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> di depannya. Ia penurut.","t01-10-1":"10. — Di meja sebelahnya ada <b>Ludovikus,</b> <b>Antonius</b> dan <b>Paulus.</b> Ludovikus menghafalkan <b>pelajarannya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> dan menjawab <b>pertanyaan-pertanyaan</b> guru. Antonius <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> sangat tidak memperhatikan ; kadang-kadang guru bahkan menghukumnya. Paulus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> kawan yang baik, ramah dan suka menolong. Ia sangat penuh perhatian.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Murid-murid yang buruk.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Di belakang Henrikus duduk <b>Georgius</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Ia bukan anak yang jahat, tetapi ia <b>suka mengobrol,</b> tidak memperhatikan dan nakal. <b>Keisengannya</b> dan <b>kebandelannya</b> menimbulkan <b>keributan</b> selama pelajaran, dan sering ia pantas mendapat <b>teguran</b> keras. <b>Buku buramnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> kotor ; ia <b>menodainya dengan tinta</b> dari <b>penanya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, dan karena itu ia selalu memakai <b>karet penghapusnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button> ; <b>map bukunya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> sobek, sebab ia sangat ceroboh. Mengapa pula ia membawa <b>tempat pensilnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> ke ruang kelas <b>bahasa-bahasa hidup?</b>","t01-11-2":"Tetangganya, Edmundus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button>, tidak menyukainya. Memang ia agak lamban, tetapi ia pendiam dan tenang. Ia tidak mengobrol ; hanya, alih-alih mendengarkan, ia lebih suka membaca <b>cerita-cerita</b> dalam <b>buku bacaannya.</b>","t01-11-3":"Murid ketiga di bangku ini adalah <b>Ludovikus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Ia tekun. Ia menulis di atas <b>lembar kertas</b> putih. Di depannya ia meletakkan <b>kertas isapnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Murid-murid di bangku kedua, di sebelah kiri guru, masih sangat muda. Yang pertama, si kecil <b>Emilius,</b> belum pandai benar menulis ; ia membawa <b>sabaknya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, <b>pensil sabaknya</b> dan <b>sponsnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Di sebelahnya ada <b>Augustus</b> dan <b>Bernardus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Yang terakhir ini bekerja dengan baik, tetapi <b>pakaiannya</b> sangat tidak terurus.","t01-13-1":"13. — Di belakang mereka duduk tiga anak <b>pemalas. Albertus</b> tidak menghafal pelajarannya. <b>Iakobus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> tidur alih-alih mendengarkan. <b>Kemalasannya</b> mendatangkan <b>teguran</b> dan bahkan <b>hukuman</b> baginya. Akhirnya <b>Kristianus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> terlalu tidak bersungguh-sungguh. Ia <b>berkelakuan</b> buruk dan sama sekali tidak berusaha memperbaiki diri.","t01-14-1":"14. — Sebaliknya, tetangga-tetangganya berkelakuan baik. <b>Ernestus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> menyukai ketertiban dan keteraturan ; ia selalu memakai <b>penggarisnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> dan <b>pensilnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Ia <b>murid luar.</b>","t01-14-2":"<b>Franciskus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> <b>murid asrama</b> ; ia berpakaian seragam, makan dan tidur di sekolah menengah itu. Ia <b>kawan</b> yang baik.","t01-14-3":"Mauricius meraut <b>pensilnya</b> dengan <b>pisau rautnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button> ; ia sangat cermat.","t01-14-4":"Ia membawa semua bukunya, <b>tata bahasanya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, <b>buku catatannya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, dan bahkan <b>alas tulisnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. <b>Tas sekolahnya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> ada di lantai di belakangnya.","t01-14-5":"Kedua meja di ujung ruang kelas ditempati oleh <b>murid-murid yang baik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Menggambar dan musik.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — Di <b>ruang menggambar</b> ada <b>model-model</b> yang indah tergantung di dinding dan sebuah <b>lampu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> dengan <b>kap lampunya,</b> tergantung di langit-langit. <b>Gurunya</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> sangat sabar ; ia membetulkan <b>gambar-gambar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> murid dan mengajar mereka menggambar <b>patung dada</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> menurut alam.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>Ruang musik</b> tampak sangat menarik. Di sana orang belajar membaca <b>musik,</b> menyanyikan <b>not-not</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> yang ditulis di atas <b>garis paranada</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), mengenal <b>kunci-kunci</b> dan menyanyikan <b>lagu-lagu</b> yang merdu. Lembaran musik diletakkan di <b>standar not</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Salah seorang murid <b>bermain piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> dan <b>guru musik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>mengetuk irama</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Kita mulai melihat sudut <b>bengkel</b> untuk <b>kerajinan tangan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, tempat anak-anak boleh belajar menyerut kayu dan mengikir besi. Hal itu tidak ada di semua sekolah menengah.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Ruang ilmu pengetahuan.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Guru matematika mengajarkan <b>kepada</b> murid-murid <b>ilmu ukur, ilmu hitung, berhitung</b> dan <b>sistem metrik</b>. Di papan tulis kita melihat bangun-bangun geometri yang utama : <b>lingkaran</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>bujur sangkar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>segitiga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>garis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Kita juga melihat sebuah <b>operasi hitung</b> ; itu bukan <b>penjumlahan,</b> bukan <b>pengurangan,</b> bukan pula <b>perkalian</b> — itu memang <b>pembagian</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Pada papan sistem metrik kita melihat : <b>meter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>timbangan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> dengan <b>anak-anak timbangannya,</b> <b>liter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>dekaliter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>desiliter</b> dan <b>meter kubik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Murid-murid juga mempelajari <b>ilmu alam</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, ilmu hewan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, ilmu tumbuhan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, ilmu bumi <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> dan <b>sejarah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Di dalam lemari ada alat-alat untuk <b>fisika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> dan untuk <b>kimia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Di atas lemari ada : <b>bola</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>kerucut</b> dan <b>bola dunia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Di atas papan-papan itu tergantung sebuah <b>peta</b> yang menggambarkan kelima bagian dunia : <b>Eropa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afrika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Amerika</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> dan <b>Oseania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, serta kedua samudra besar, <b>Pasifik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> dan <b>Atlantik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Untuk <i>nama baptis</i> pun disarankan menyalinnya menurut bentuk Latin. Itulah satu-satunya jalan untuk menghindari perbedaan yang tak terhitung. Lagi pula, bagaimana memilih di antara <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> dan sebagainya? Apakah kita akan membuat kamus khusus untuk nama baptis? Marilah kita ambil bentuk nominatifnya dari bahasa Latin dan mengatakan : <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Kompleta)."}}
